  "description": "The course is composed of 3 parts: Part 1 is for overview of JAVA technology and strengthening the basic knowledge and skills in java programming language such as using multi- threading programming, GUI programming, processing graphics, Java internationalization utilities Part 2 is for developing Java distributed applications Part 3 is for developing Java database applications",
  "learning_outcomes": [
    {
      "No.": "1",
      "CLO Name": "CLO1",
      "CLO Details": "Discuss the concept of concurrency programming and muti-threading application"
    },
    {
